(4445880, 640596, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle on this shot with a very good depth of focus. The backround is a little bland but it helps to keep the attention on the hummingbird. The focus is actually on the back third of the bird but I realize how difficult it is to get these shots unless you prefocus and take your chances! The stop action on the wings is excellent. The red in the throat is a little oversaturated but again I understand the difficulty here especially using a flash. Overall, a very good picture. 8</td>', 'Very nice angle on this shot with a very good depth of focus. The backround is a little bland but it helps to keep the attention on the hummingbird. The focus is actually on the back third of the bird but I realize how difficult it is to get these shots unless you prefocus and take your chances! The stop action on the wings is excellent. The red in the throat is a little oversaturated but again I understand the difficulty here especially using a flash. Overall, a very good picture. 8', '2008-02-01 09:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
