(4446357, 638345, 3102, '<td valign="top">You need to let the exposure go a little longer to get some detail in the buildings.  As it is, there are just points of light.</td>', 'You need to let the exposure go a little longer to get some detail in the buildings.  As it is, there are just points of light.', '2008-02-01 10:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446378, 639803, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb, there is no way these will end up sub-5. You just got some early bad votes. They are really beautiful, actually. I confess I don''t like the processing quite as much as Neil''s, but close. I think you will end up doing just fine, and if not, poo on the silly voters and make yourself a gorgeous poster!</td>', 'Deb, there is no way these will end up sub-5. You just got some early bad votes. They are really beautiful, actually. I confess I don''t like the processing quite as much as Neil''s, but close. I think you will end up doing just fine, and if not, poo on the silly voters and make yourself a gorgeous poster!', '2008-02-01 11:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446384, 637592, 85886, '<td valign="top">With a bit more contrast this would be pure Ansel - nice work</td>', 'With a bit more contrast this would be pure Ansel - nice work', '2008-02-01 11:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446390, 632405, 85886, '<td valign="top">Whoever it is, why are they balancing on a rail when there''s a tripod right next to them?!   Nice shot but I think the selective saturation doesn''t have as much impact as a b&amp;w version might.</td>', 'Whoever it is, why are they balancing on a rail when there''s a tripod right next to them?!   Nice shot but I think the selective saturation doesn''t have as much impact as a b&w version might.', '2008-02-01 11:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446400, 635468, 66267, '<td valign="top">Very artsy. I''m sure there are voters who aren''t too happy about the processing, but I''d love to have this on my wall. 7</td>', 'Very artsy. I''m sure there are voters who aren''t too happy about the processing, but I''d love to have this on my wall. 7', '2008-02-01 11:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446401, 631004, 85886, '<td valign="top">Hot :)  I like the pose and the lighting - seems like it''s a touch too much on the right hand side of her face, but I''m still very much a novice to this kind of lighting.  Very attractive photograph..I think it''s her expression which is quizzical.</td>', 'Hot :)  I like the pose and the lighting - seems like it''s a touch too much on the right hand side of her face, but I''m still very much a novice to this kind of lighting.  Very attractive photograph..I think it''s her expression which is quizzical.', '2008-02-01 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446413, 640853, 85886, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what''s going on here but I love this shot for the lighting and colours.  To me it doesn''t matter that there''s grain or focus issues because that lovely ribbon of light at night is just eye candy to this voters eyes :)  The pole definitely makes the shot, nicely placed at 3rds.  I don''t think others will feel the same way so I''m giving you a +1 to compensate ;)</td>', 'I don''t know what''s going on here but I love this shot for the lighting and colours.  To me it doesn''t matter that there''s grain or focus issues because that lovely ribbon of light at night is just eye candy to this voters eyes :)  The pole definitely makes the shot, nicely placed at 3rds.  I don''t think others will feel the same way so I''m giving you a +1 to compensate ;)', '2008-02-01 11:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446425, 640526, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I think you could really bring out the colours in the sea and sky to make this shot pop.</td>', 'Great shot but I think you could really bring out the colours in the sea and sky to make this shot pop.', '2008-02-01 11:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446431, 640673, 85886, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot and beautifully edited - just to the point of surreality but keeping it real and so punchy.  A favourite so far.</td>', 'Outstanding shot and beautifully edited - just to the point of surreality but keeping it real and so punchy.  A favourite so far.', '2008-02-01 11:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446439, 637910, 85886, '<td valign="top">The post processing feels a bit OTT on her face, giving her an almost painted feel.  If this is what you were aiming for, grats.</td>', 'The post processing feels a bit OTT on her face, giving her an almost painted feel.  If this is what you were aiming for, grats.', '2008-02-01 11:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446472, 633017, 19708, '<td valign="top">Truly an amazing photograph. <br/>Something I would expect to see in the finest publications or encyclopedias.<br/>Congrats on this.</td>', 'Truly an amazing photograph. Something I would expect to see in the finest publications or encyclopedias.Congrats on this.', '2008-02-01 11:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
