(4446498, 640435, 65468, '<td valign="top">Great image quality and focus. For me I try not to crop an animal unless it is a head shot, I feel it has more impact.  But thats me.</td>', 'Great image quality and focus. For me I try not to crop an animal unless it is a head shot, I feel it has more impact.  But thats me.', '2008-02-01 11:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
