(4447086, 640528, 67723, '<td valign="top">Ah I see another photographer that has decided to throw his photo into a confused pot of other photos only to be hammered and tossed around unmercifully by other voters.  Here''s a 10... go with it and have fun, for the trollologist predicted that tomorrow the trolls are expected to throw a grand party in which photos like these will be used as doormats.  Excuse the extras, the point I am trying to get across is well done on both the photographing and the processing...</td>', 'Ah I see another photographer that has decided to throw his photo into a confused pot of other photos only to be hammered and tossed around unmercifully by other voters.  Here''s a 10... go with it and have fun, for the trollologist predicted that tomorrow the trolls are expected to throw a grand party in which photos like these will be used as doormats.  Excuse the extras, the point I am trying to get across is well done on both the photographing and the processing...', '2008-02-01 14:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
