(4447492, 640852, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great job on the HDR with a perfect touch.  The textures are lovely, as is the scene but what really makes this stand out for me is the red light inside the lighthouse and the light it makes on the rocks.</td>', 'Great job on the HDR with a perfect touch.  The textures are lovely, as is the scene but what really makes this stand out for me is the red light inside the lighthouse and the light it makes on the rocks.', '2008-02-01 15:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
