(4450840, 638759, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Excellent idea.  Can''t believe you did that for a challenge.  But I''ll bet it was fun!  (Commenting only, no vote.)</td>', 'LOL!  Excellent idea.  Can''t believe you did that for a challenge.  But I''ll bet it was fun!  (Commenting only, no vote.)', '2008-02-02 14:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
