(4450885, 638674, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice scene, sky is gorgeous.  ''If only'' a little more light in the fore to bring the horse into play more and, could just be a visual thing, but the land and building looks like it needs a whisker nudge up on the left.</td>', '7 - Nice scene, sky is gorgeous.  ''If only'' a little more light in the fore to bring the horse into play more and, could just be a visual thing, but the land and building looks like it needs a whisker nudge up on the left.', '2008-02-02 14:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450898, 640059, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Like the way the water seems to be flowing ''to'' the viewer.  At first I imagined this with more of a horizontal framing, to allow the fore ''expanse'' to come into play more - might work, anyway your call of course.  Don''t know how difficult it would be, but an even stronger perspective (ground up) make an unusual image.  Apologies in advance if wrong, but, this seems like it needs a whisker nudge rotate up on the left - but could just be a visual thing.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Like the way the water seems to be flowing ''to'' the viewer.  At first I imagined this with more of a horizontal framing, to allow the fore ''expanse'' to come into play more - might work, anyway your call of course.  Don''t know how difficult it would be, but an even stronger perspective (ground up) make an unusual image.  Apologies in advance if wrong, but, this seems like it needs a whisker nudge rotate up on the left - but could just be a visual thing.', '2008-02-02 14:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450901, 640602, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture - difficult one to get.  Framing works well (although wonder about a variation in color to enhance the bird).  Nice image.</td>', '7 - Nice capture - difficult one to get.  Framing works well (although wonder about a variation in color to enhance the bird).  Nice image.', '2008-02-02 14:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
