(4466494, 637807, 83313, '<td valign="top">a lot of good potential in this one, though I don''t find it to be quite there. I''m not sure if the subject is the trees, or the river scene they are framing.  I think if the scene was cropped a bit, it would help guide the eye toward the river as the subject. the other problem is the blown out highlight on the opposite shore. If there are details there in the out of the camera shot, you could do some selective adjustments on the image to keep those details but still bring out the shadow detail in the trees.</td>', 'a lot of good potential in this one, though I don''t find it to be quite there. I''m not sure if the subject is the trees, or the river scene they are framing.  I think if the scene was cropped a bit, it would help guide the eye toward the river as the subject. the other problem is the blown out highlight on the opposite shore. If there are details there in the out of the camera shot, you could do some selective adjustments on the image to keep those details but still bring out the shadow detail in the trees.', '2008-02-06 22:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
