(4466692, 640596, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I can see some noise on the wing, but heck, I feel awkward even mentioning it, because of what it takes to stop one of these in motion this way.</td>', 'Very nice! I can see some noise on the wing, but heck, I feel awkward even mentioning it, because of what it takes to stop one of these in motion this way.', '2008-02-06 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
