(4467617, 640792, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge bird fan but I love that.  Beautiful bokeh. The composition is well done. I just wish he had a touch more light on his face by the eye.</td>', 'I''m not a huge bird fan but I love that.  Beautiful bokeh. The composition is well done. I just wish he had a touch more light on his face by the eye.', '2008-02-07 08:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
