(4467666, 640014, 69109, '<td valign="top">Very precisely focused, the details are awesome! The colors and the smooth bokeh make the photograph very powerful. If I have to find something to improve...mmmh...I would be curious what a wider perpective of the animal could have done. But with such a shallow DOF you probably have chosen the right composition.</td>', 'Very precisely focused, the details are awesome! The colors and the smooth bokeh make the photograph very powerful. If I have to find something to improve...mmmh...I would be curious what a wider perpective of the animal could have done. But with such a shallow DOF you probably have chosen the right composition.', '2008-02-07 09:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
