(4467694, 630855, 50695, '<td valign="top">A little too dodgy-burny for my taste, but I like the cinematic drama of it. (the dodgy-burny makes it less cinematic) You really didn''t have to put a spotlight on her.</td>', 'A little too dodgy-burny for my taste, but I like the cinematic drama of it. (the dodgy-burny makes it less cinematic) You really didn''t have to put a spotlight on her.', '2008-02-07 09:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
