(4468869, 634058, 61651, '<td valign="top">Love the processing and the concept - excellent, creative image.</td>', 'Love the processing and the concept - excellent, creative image.', '2008-02-07 16:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468878, 638481, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and sharpness, interesting composition, too.  Motion blur of the background would have made this outstanding!  I know, easier said than done.</td>', 'I like the colors and sharpness, interesting composition, too.  Motion blur of the background would have made this outstanding!  I know, easier said than done.', '2008-02-07 16:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468880, 632953, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice rainbow, I like the way it blends with the whispy clouds.  I think your border is way too heavy for this photo - maybe a thin white border would have served this better?</td>', 'Nice rainbow, I like the way it blends with the whispy clouds.  I think your border is way too heavy for this photo - maybe a thin white border would have served this better?', '2008-02-07 16:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468897, 630949, 61961, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject, but the lazy point of view (shooting angle) and lack of sharpness really detract.</td>', 'Wonderful subject, but the lazy point of view (shooting angle) and lack of sharpness really detract.', '2008-02-07 17:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468898, 630103, 61961, '<td valign="top">Oops, I started to leave a comment and changed my mind, but just realized I had submitted an empty comment with only the word "I".  Anyhow, to complete my thought, I think the mixed lighting makes this appear too artificial -- it seems as if the girl is standing in front of a poster of the sea (maybe she was?).</td>', 'Oops, I started to leave a comment and changed my mind, but just realized I had submitted an empty comment with only the word "I".  Anyhow, to complete my thought, I think the mixed lighting makes this appear too artificial -- it seems as if the girl is standing in front of a poster of the sea (maybe she was?).', '2008-02-07 17:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468950, 636534, 61961, '<td valign="top">Bob looks like a girl. :-D<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Bob looks like a girl. :-DWell done.', '2008-02-07 17:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468953, 637910, 61961, '<td valign="top">On one hand, I think this is overdone (too smooth, eyes too white).  On the other hand, the result has the look of an old-fashioned painted hand-painted photo that I find very appealing.</td>', 'On one hand, I think this is overdone (too smooth, eyes too white).  On the other hand, the result has the look of an old-fashioned painted hand-painted photo that I find very appealing.', '2008-02-07 17:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468954, 635266, 61961, '<td valign="top">A little over-processed for my personal taste, but a strong photo anyway.  Great moment, good clarity, love the deep black background.</td>', 'A little over-processed for my personal taste, but a strong photo anyway.  Great moment, good clarity, love the deep black background.', '2008-02-07 17:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469017, 638548, 69684, '<td valign="top">Give this a golden border and you can put it in a museum as a wonderful painting. Well done!</td>', 'Give this a golden border and you can put it in a museum as a wonderful painting. Well done!', '2008-02-07 17:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469031, 629530, 69684, '<td valign="top">Just wondering what your thoughts were, when you made this wonderful shot. I''m feeling so cold just looking at this.</td>', 'Just wondering what your thoughts were, when you made this wonderful shot. I''m feeling so cold just looking at this.', '2008-02-07 17:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469034, 640876, 69684, '<td valign="top">The little piece of brown is for me just the finishing touch. Wonderful!</td>', 'The little piece of brown is for me just the finishing touch. Wonderful!', '2008-02-07 17:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469096, 640852, 29011, '<td valign="top">I saw the similarity between this and another shot in the challenge. I''m leaning towards liking this one a bit more. I certainly like the sky better here, and the composition. Sharpening is slightly less agressive here, looks great. The tonemapping looks good on both. I like the mood in this one. Wouldn''t have minded just a sliver of more brightness ala the glow on the rocks like in the other shot, but just a pinch really. *bump*</td>', 'I saw the similarity between this and another shot in the challenge. I''m leaning towards liking this one a bit more. I certainly like the sky better here, and the composition. Sharpening is slightly less agressive here, looks great. The tonemapping looks good on both. I like the mood in this one. Wouldn''t have minded just a sliver of more brightness ala the glow on the rocks like in the other shot, but just a pinch really. *bump*', '2008-02-07 18:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469099, 637979, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very slick and cool shot. The green top of the strawberry looks a bit too bright here though.</td>', 'Very slick and cool shot. The green top of the strawberry looks a bit too bright here though.', '2008-02-07 18:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469100, 640060, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like this environmental portait. *bump*</td>', 'Very nice. I like this environmental portait. *bump*', '2008-02-07 18:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469103, 633081, 29011, '<td valign="top">This looks really good. I like it all, the composition, lighting, except that the shot has a green cast. Wish it looked more golden color. Could be the color calibration that''s in the way.</td>', 'This looks really good. I like it all, the composition, lighting, except that the shot has a green cast. Wish it looked more golden color. Could be the color calibration that''s in the way.', '2008-02-07 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469104, 632953, 29011, '<td valign="top">Cool! A sun dog 8) Very pretty.</td>', 'Cool! A sun dog 8) Very pretty.', '2008-02-07 18:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469326, 633136, 61961, '<td valign="top">Bumped you up to a 10 earlier today, just dropping by to say best wishes!</td>', 'Bumped you up to a 10 earlier today, just dropping by to say best wishes!', '2008-02-07 20:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469335, 640698, 61961, '<td valign="top">This is terrific, you really catch the power of the wave and the tensed muscles of the lone figure waiting to be engulfed.  Best of all is this feels like a photographic triumph and not a post-processing one.  I hope others like it as much as I do!</td>', 'This is terrific, you really catch the power of the wave and the tensed muscles of the lone figure waiting to be engulfed.  Best of all is this feels like a photographic triumph and not a post-processing one.  I hope others like it as much as I do!', '2008-02-07 20:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469348, 637883, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can see the reason for the title. Your treatment of this makes it look almost like an artists conception drawing. I like it.</td>', 'I can see the reason for the title. Your treatment of this makes it look almost like an artists conception drawing. I like it.', '2008-02-07 20:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469353, 640639, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, however I hate cigarettes, and that nasty thing in her mouth lowers her attractiveness by a couple of notches. I ain''t gonna let it affect my vote, though.</td>', 'Nice photo, however I hate cigarettes, and that nasty thing in her mouth lowers her attractiveness by a couple of notches. I ain''t gonna let it affect my vote, though.', '2008-02-07 20:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469359, 640498, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice PP effects on this. Hard to get this kind of impact in b/w. I''d love to know how you did this one. I''ll be looking for some photographer''s notes after the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice PP effects on this. Hard to get this kind of impact in b/w. I''d love to know how you did this one. I''ll be looking for some photographer''s notes after the challenge.', '2008-02-07 20:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469368, 640878, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of neat looking, a nice contrasty b/w with some punch. However, my eye goes up the branch, looking toward the part of it that is not in the frame. I think it is because more brightness is in the top of the image.</td>', 'Kind of neat looking, a nice contrasty b/w with some punch. However, my eye goes up the branch, looking toward the part of it that is not in the frame. I think it is because more brightness is in the top of the image.', '2008-02-07 20:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469377, 640827, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like the look of these with the ice on them, and I especially like the touch of one of them is spinning. I think the scenic background distracts from the main subject quite a bit, however. Getting closer in would have shown off more detail and excluded the distracting background.</td>', 'I really like the look of these with the ice on them, and I especially like the touch of one of them is spinning. I think the scenic background distracts from the main subject quite a bit, however. Getting closer in would have shown off more detail and excluded the distracting background.', '2008-02-07 20:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469386, 639709, 83313, '<td valign="top">A great view, but there''s not a lot of detail showing and the whole shot is fairly low contrast. To be fair, these things don''t exactly pose and it''s a better capture than I could have done.</td>', 'A great view, but there''s not a lot of detail showing and the whole shot is fairly low contrast. To be fair, these things don''t exactly pose and it''s a better capture than I could have done.', '2008-02-07 20:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469389, 639950, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the appearance of the snow covered branches, but the whole shot seems a bit busy for me and my eye is really not being led to a subject.</td>', 'I like the appearance of the snow covered branches, but the whole shot seems a bit busy for me and my eye is really not being led to a subject.', '2008-02-07 20:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469393, 633427, 35804, '<td valign="top">...oh good grief..."This photo has been validated"...<br/> <br/>Great catch.</td>', '...oh good grief..."This photo has been validated"... Great catch.', '2008-02-07 20:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469399, 639422, 83313, '<td valign="top">Your file size is only about 83k when you could have used up to 200k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is surely taking some detail out of your photo. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.<br/> <br/>The blown highlights and shadows are a bit of a problem on this as well. Strong sun is a challenge to shoot in.</td>', 'Your file size is only about 83k when you could have used up to 200k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is surely taking some detail out of your photo. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over. The blown highlights and shadows are a bit of a problem on this as well. Strong sun is a challenge to shoot in.', '2008-02-07 20:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469404, 640425, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s  a nice image, with great smooth tones. Just right and not overdone. It just does not stand out to me from so many other sunset shots.</td>', 'It''s  a nice image, with great smooth tones. Just right and not overdone. It just does not stand out to me from so many other sunset shots.', '2008-02-07 20:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469410, 637390, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit oversharpened and that''s cutting off 1 point on my rating, but otherwise quite good.</td>', 'Maybe a bit oversharpened and that''s cutting off 1 point on my rating, but otherwise quite good.', '2008-02-07 20:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469412, 640187, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is really good and a totally unexpected image.</td>', 'This is really good and a totally unexpected image.', '2008-02-07 20:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469416, 640703, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the blown out bright opening. Maybe a closer view of the sax player might have done better with me. I think some others may really like this one, though.</td>', 'I don''t care for the blown out bright opening. Maybe a closer view of the sax player might have done better with me. I think some others may really like this one, though.', '2008-02-07 20:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469421, 636306, 83313, '<td valign="top">Why isn''t this in the eyes challenge?! This is really good, so I''ll assume you had something even better for "eyes".</td>', 'Why isn''t this in the eyes challenge?! This is really good, so I''ll assume you had something even better for "eyes".', '2008-02-07 20:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
