(4469638, 638264, 90005, '<td valign="top">This is tricky. In one way I like it a lot, because of the greens and textures, but another I wish it told more of a story. I don''t understand it - and I do not feel that I need to understand it. But, because I don''t understand it makes the flow for me stop. It loses it visual impact.</td>', 'This is tricky. In one way I like it a lot, because of the greens and textures, but another I wish it told more of a story. I don''t understand it - and I do not feel that I need to understand it. But, because I don''t understand it makes the flow for me stop. It loses it visual impact.', '2008-02-07 22:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
