(4469965, 634682, 80859, '<td valign="top">i think this is a great shot.  i like surrealism.  i gave it a 10, but i never had time to make comments during the voting.</td>', 'i think this is a great shot.  i like surrealism.  i gave it a 10, but i never had time to make comments during the voting.', '2008-02-08 00:10:08.000000', NULL, 0),
