(4469967, 636534, 75386, '<td valign="top">4.7???<br/> <br/>Oh well, I guess i shouldnt of expected this to place higher here. <br/> <br/>Great photo!</td>', '4.7??? Oh well, I guess i shouldnt of expected this to place higher here.  Great photo!', '2008-02-08 00:11:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4469968, 640869, 56109, '<td valign="top">At first glance I was wondering why in the heck you didn''t submit this photo to the bird challange, but I checked out you entry and your other bird one is a favorite. Actually I can''t decide. Both are such great shots I''ve never seen. I think the tight crop works really well here and the expression of the fish really adds to the photo. Another zoo shot? (cheater) .....jk</td>', 'At first glance I was wondering why in the heck you didn''t submit this photo to the bird challange, but I checked out you entry and your other bird one is a favorite. Actually I can''t decide. Both are such great shots I''ve never seen. I think the tight crop works really well here and the expression of the fish really adds to the photo. Another zoo shot? (cheater) .....jk', '2008-02-08 00:12:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4469969, 640014, 69325, '<td valign="top">congrats on ANOTHER top ten my dear! Beautiful work as always. You def. got higher than 6.2</td>', 'congrats on ANOTHER top ten my dear! Beautiful work as always. You def. got higher than 6.2', '2008-02-08 00:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
