(4470168, 629212, 68504, '<td valign="top">This <i>is</i> cool: the blocks of banding - cloud, sun streak, sea and sand make an exceptional abstract composition.  I would have cropped a bit off the left, an inch or so, to emphasize the hooded figure.  (Also clone out whatever that is going from the nose to the top of the hood. Not that I have ever cloned anything myself, but soon...).  It would still be too dark for dpc, but not for me.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is cool: the blocks of banding - cloud, sun streak, sea and sand make an exceptional abstract composition.  I would have cropped a bit off the left, an inch or so, to emphasize the hooded figure.  (Also clone out whatever that is going from the nose to the top of the hood. Not that I have ever cloned anything myself, but soon...).  It would still be too dark for dpc, but not for me.  Good luck.', '2008-02-08 02:00:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470169, 637941, 39427, '<td valign="top">love the title.  (great picture too :D)</td>', 'love the title.  (great picture too :D)', '2008-02-08 02:01:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470172, 638137, 33535, '<td valign="top">wow, what a shot! adding to may favs<br/>congrats on a well deserved win!</td>', 'wow, what a shot! adding to may favscongrats on a well deserved win!', '2008-02-08 02:09:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470177, 635266, 33535, '<td valign="top">that must have felt good! LOL<br/>congrats, it''s an awesome shot, one of the best i''ve seen in a while and you deserved a higher place imo!</td>', 'that must have felt good! LOLcongrats, it''s an awesome shot, one of the best i''ve seen in a while and you deserved a higher place imo!', '2008-02-08 02:13:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470181, 638471, 68504, '<td valign="top">The light and colour and composition are pretty good, and you managed to get the shine on the leaf and the iridescence on bug legs and spots, no small thing.  Macro focus is extremely difficult even with a tripod, and at f2.8 you have to decide on a very thin plane of focus, which is a difficult call with a roundish bug.  Smaller aperture would help.  Good Luck.</td>', 'The light and colour and composition are pretty good, and you managed to get the shine on the leaf and the iridescence on bug legs and spots, no small thing.  Macro focus is extremely difficult even with a tripod, and at f2.8 you have to decide on a very thin plane of focus, which is a difficult call with a roundish bug.  Smaller aperture would help.  Good Luck.', '2008-02-08 02:19:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470195, 639572, 68956, '<td valign="top">I would have expected this to be higher - as long as you know you''ve produced a great image there ;)</td>', 'I would have expected this to be higher - as long as you know you''ve produced a great image there ;)', '2008-02-08 02:34:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470199, 639803, 68956, '<td valign="top">I like it very much :)</td>', 'I like it very much :)', '2008-02-08 02:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470218, 638977, 78196, '<td valign="top">Firstly, the B&amp;W is contrasty and well-controlled, and the moment you''ve captured is a lovely one. My biggest gripe is that the grainy conversion doesn''t suit the nature of the photograph - I would think this sort of look would be more appropriate for high-energy scenes, gritty street shots etc. rather than the subtler and more human moment you''ve shot here. I think it''s this disparity that''s resulted in the low score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-08 21:41:27.</i></td>', 'Firstly, the B&W is contrasty and well-controlled, and the moment you''ve captured is a lovely one. My biggest gripe is that the grainy conversion doesn''t suit the nature of the photograph - I would think this sort of look would be more appropriate for high-energy scenes, gritty street shots etc. rather than the subtler and more human moment you''ve shot here. I think it''s this disparity that''s resulted in the low score.', '2008-02-08 02:58:45.000000', '2008-02-08 21:41:27.000000', 0),
(4470222, 640869, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 4th, outstanding image!</td>', 'Congrats on your 4th, outstanding image!', '2008-02-08 03:00:19.000000', NULL, 0),
