(4470397, 640014, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well given how well you did in the Yellow Challenge it looks like you made the right call.  Another outstanding macro and congratulations on the top ten placement.<br/> <br/>Stunning sharpness</td>', 'Well given how well you did in the Yellow Challenge it looks like you made the right call.  Another outstanding macro and congratulations on the top ten placement. Stunning sharpness', '2008-02-08 05:51:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470400, 636559, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great shot that depicts both the majesty of a large ship and the sadness of decay (bizarrely I can see a sad ''face'' in the vessel.  I love the composition because you get a real sense of the ship looming above you without it being overpowering<br/> <br/>Beautiful use of colour in terms of the splash of muted red in the frame.  How anyone gave this a 4,3 or 2 is beyond me</td>', 'Great shot that depicts both the majesty of a large ship and the sadness of decay (bizarrely I can see a sad ''face'' in the vessel.  I love the composition because you get a real sense of the ship looming above you without it being overpowering Beautiful use of colour in terms of the splash of muted red in the frame.  How anyone gave this a 4,3 or 2 is beyond me', '2008-02-08 05:55:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470401, 640819, 71608, '<td valign="top">I think this is an absolute lovely image, an amazing capture! I love how it''s understated, and how the composition draws your eyes to the ripple. The wobbly reflections work well, however I''d be interested to see it down with a little more light/detail in the tree :)</td>', 'I think this is an absolute lovely image, an amazing capture! I love how it''s understated, and how the composition draws your eyes to the ripple. The wobbly reflections work well, however I''d be interested to see it down with a little more light/detail in the tree :)', '2008-02-08 05:57:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470402, 640305, 60899, '<td valign="top">Nice tone and futuristic look and feel :)</td>', 'Nice tone and futuristic look and feel :)', '2008-02-08 05:57:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470404, 638581, 71608, '<td valign="top">I think this is great! The lighting is perfect, enabling you to see every little bit of action in the frame... the character and personalities shine through! I really love the composition, it just draws your eye in then lets it roam around. Great black and white conversion too!</td>', 'I think this is great! The lighting is perfect, enabling you to see every little bit of action in the frame... the character and personalities shine through! I really love the composition, it just draws your eye in then lets it roam around. Great black and white conversion too!', '2008-02-08 05:58:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470406, 640854, 78196, '<td valign="top">I''m not an expert on high key but as a general rule I think it works better for lighter subjects than contrasty ones. As a result the background looks overexposed rather than high-key. A little bit of USM (or more USM!) on the bird would have preferable as well I think. The capture itself is nothing short of remarkable and with some effective processing (this would work well in B&amp;W you know) it''s potentially a real winner. Well done!</td>', 'I''m not an expert on high key but as a general rule I think it works better for lighter subjects than contrasty ones. As a result the background looks overexposed rather than high-key. A little bit of USM (or more USM!) on the bird would have preferable as well I think. The capture itself is nothing short of remarkable and with some effective processing (this would work well in B&W you know) it''s potentially a real winner. Well done!', '2008-02-08 06:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470407, 640430, 71608, '<td valign="top">I really like the post-processing on this - subtle, and really well done! I love the image you captured, it just speaks to me somehow, lol. Very well taken photograph :)</td>', 'I really like the post-processing on this - subtle, and really well done! I love the image you captured, it just speaks to me somehow, lol. Very well taken photograph :)', '2008-02-08 06:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470408, 637992, 68035, '<td valign="top">Michelle, from my perspective your fears about the blow out are unfounded as the way you have PP''s the shot takes it away from blow out and actually makes a high key feature of it.  Very nice capture and I hope you had a good time at the refuge</td>', 'Michelle, from my perspective your fears about the blow out are unfounded as the way you have PP''s the shot takes it away from blow out and actually makes a high key feature of it.  Very nice capture and I hope you had a good time at the refuge', '2008-02-08 06:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470409, 638552, 71608, '<td valign="top">I actually really like the DOF on this one! The only thing I could suggest is a closer crop, as I really want to see the in-focus berries more up close :) Well done!</td>', 'I actually really like the DOF on this one! The only thing I could suggest is a closer crop, as I really want to see the in-focus berries more up close :) Well done!', '2008-02-08 06:01:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470411, 640974, 78196, '<td valign="top">I like this. Our eyes are immediately drawn outside the frame as we share the dog''s obvious curiosity. I would have liked to see this in B&amp;W I must admit. This is never a shot that''s going to do well on DPC, which I guess you knew already, but kudos for submitting it!</td>', 'I like this. Our eyes are immediately drawn outside the frame as we share the dog''s obvious curiosity. I would have liked to see this in B&W I must admit. This is never a shot that''s going to do well on DPC, which I guess you knew already, but kudos for submitting it!', '2008-02-08 06:02:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470414, 637789, 68035, '<td valign="top">I love this, it makes me think of the aliens from the original version of War of the World.  Fantastic PP on the sky and clouds.  I love this image and I (really) cant believe it did not score higher</td>', 'I love this, it makes me think of the aliens from the original version of War of the World.  Fantastic PP on the sky and clouds.  I love this image and I (really) cant believe it did not score higher', '2008-02-08 06:04:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470415, 639331, 60899, '<td valign="top">Gr8 snap ... love the strong contrast and colors</td>', 'Gr8 snap ... love the strong contrast and colors', '2008-02-08 06:07:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470417, 640703, 71608, '<td valign="top">I really love the effect the post-processing had on the tunnel and the sax player, and the moment you captured is lovely! However the empty space on the right doesn''t quite work for me... perhaps a closer crop, or not so blown-out on that area. Otherwise, great shot!</td>', 'I really love the effect the post-processing had on the tunnel and the sax player, and the moment you captured is lovely! However the empty space on the right doesn''t quite work for me... perhaps a closer crop, or not so blown-out on that area. Otherwise, great shot!', '2008-02-08 06:08:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470418, 640534, 71608, '<td valign="top">I like the muted colours, it really complements the threatening sky... great shot! Perhaps more focus on the boat with the mast could also add to it, giving more perspective to the sizes etc. Well done!</td>', 'I like the muted colours, it really complements the threatening sky... great shot! Perhaps more focus on the boat with the mast could also add to it, giving more perspective to the sizes etc. Well done!', '2008-02-08 06:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470419, 640490, 78196, '<td valign="top">There''s not a lot I can add to the very constructive comments below - perhaps you could have made the sunlight on the rocks pop out a little bit more in contrast to the sky? The composition is nice though I wonder if you could have been a bit more daring and given us some negative space in the sky? Just an idea.</td>', 'There''s not a lot I can add to the very constructive comments below - perhaps you could have made the sunlight on the rocks pop out a little bit more in contrast to the sky? The composition is nice though I wonder if you could have been a bit more daring and given us some negative space in the sky? Just an idea.', '2008-02-08 06:11:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470423, 640673, 72103, '<td valign="top">2nd favorite on challenge, awesome</td>', '2nd favorite on challenge, awesome', '2008-02-08 06:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470424, 640014, 71608, '<td valign="top">WOW, fantastic shot Roz!</td>', 'WOW, fantastic shot Roz!', '2008-02-08 06:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470426, 630611, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice self-portrait and good result.. well done.</td>', 'Nice self-portrait and good result.. well done.', '2008-02-08 06:24:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470427, 630611, 3746, '<td valign="top">by the way, where was this shot mate?</td>', 'by the way, where was this shot mate?', '2008-02-08 06:24:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470432, 630611, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Simms:</b></div><hr/><i> by the way, where was this shot mate? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Colchester Zoo, unfortunately this chimp is very old and not in the best of health, he is the one that is always inside rocking himself against the bars. He just looked at me like this, I had to shoot him.</td>', 'Originally posted by Simms: by the way, where was this shot mate?   Colchester Zoo, unfortunately this chimp is very old and not in the best of health, he is the one that is always inside rocking himself against the bars. He just looked at me like this, I had to shoot him.', '2008-02-08 06:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470435, 638219, 85886, '<td valign="top">Yep...I gave this an 8 and really expected a top 10 finish for it.  The beautiful colours should have done it, let alone the track to infinity at 3rds, mirrored by the sign - or even the textures in the clouds.  Voter cluelessness :(<br/> <br/>EDIT:  p.s.  I think it might be the title being too matter of fact.  Seems like voters here either like soppy romantic/poetic type stuff or humour.  Everything else seems to fall flat...and in this case I really think might have overridden people''s sense of taste/appreciation/clue...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-08 06:33:35.</i></td>', 'Yep...I gave this an 8 and really expected a top 10 finish for it.  The beautiful colours should have done it, let alone the track to infinity at 3rds, mirrored by the sign - or even the textures in the clouds.  Voter cluelessness :( EDIT:  p.s.  I think it might be the title being too matter of fact.  Seems like voters here either like soppy romantic/poetic type stuff or humour.  Everything else seems to fall flat...and in this case I really think might have overridden people''s sense of taste/appreciation/clue...', '2008-02-08 06:32:15.000000', '2008-02-08 06:33:35.000000', 0),
(4470436, 640666, 3724, '<td valign="top">beautiful rendering</td>', 'beautiful rendering', '2008-02-08 06:32:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470440, 631978, 78196, '<td valign="top">Wow, I don''t know how you managed to get that close to the bird with that lens. There''s a real sense of perspective and an interaction with the bird which is excellent. As has been said before, it''s not sharp, due probably to the inadequate shutter speed/focusing issues. A sharper shot would obviously have scored better, and I would have gone for a wee bit more contrast as well.</td>', 'Wow, I don''t know how you managed to get that close to the bird with that lens. There''s a real sense of perspective and an interaction with the bird which is excellent. As has been said before, it''s not sharp, due probably to the inadequate shutter speed/focusing issues. A sharper shot would obviously have scored better, and I would have gone for a wee bit more contrast as well.', '2008-02-08 06:47:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470443, 640693, 78196, '<td valign="top">This is just terrific. I wasn''t sure at first but now I like the fact that there''s no definition between the snow and sky - it highlights the unknown into which the man is trudging to hopelessly. Wonderful stuff.</td>', 'This is just terrific. I wasn''t sure at first but now I like the fact that there''s no definition between the snow and sky - it highlights the unknown into which the man is trudging to hopelessly. Wonderful stuff.', '2008-02-08 06:49:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470445, 633148, 78196, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure, great composition with bags of character. There''s so much detail in here to hold my attention. I don''t think you could have conceivably taken this shot much better - the lack of ''wow'' factor prevents a really high score but high scores are overrated!</td>', 'Perfect exposure, great composition with bags of character. There''s so much detail in here to hold my attention. I don''t think you could have conceivably taken this shot much better - the lack of ''wow'' factor prevents a really high score but high scores are overrated!', '2008-02-08 06:52:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470446, 637396, 78196, '<td valign="top">Ooh, here''s one that got above a six and I''m not surprised. I think you realise that a smaller aperture would have been preferable to get the whole jellyfish in focus, but obviously the light conditions prevented that. In short, something very different, very well composed and very well edited. Good work!</td>', 'Ooh, here''s one that got above a six and I''m not surprised. I think you realise that a smaller aperture would have been preferable to get the whole jellyfish in focus, but obviously the light conditions prevented that. In short, something very different, very well composed and very well edited. Good work!', '2008-02-08 06:54:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470447, 638490, 7786, '<td valign="top">Congratulations with the top 10 finish. Superb image but I have to say that your ljosmyndakeppni.is entry was better processed. I think you should have entered that one.</td>', 'Congratulations with the top 10 finish. Superb image but I have to say that your ljosmyndakeppni.is entry was better processed. I think you should have entered that one.', '2008-02-08 06:54:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470448, 640059, 78196, '<td valign="top">To be quite honest I''m a bit mystified this didn''t score higher - I don''t know it it''s to do with the voter''s ennui of flowing water shots, but this one is done really well. It''s a pity the surrounding branches are lighter than the rest of the image (probably not ideal lighting conditions) as they divert our attention a little bit. But a well-executed shot nonetheless.</td>', 'To be quite honest I''m a bit mystified this didn''t score higher - I don''t know it it''s to do with the voter''s ennui of flowing water shots, but this one is done really well. It''s a pity the surrounding branches are lighter than the rest of the image (probably not ideal lighting conditions) as they divert our attention a little bit. But a well-executed shot nonetheless.', '2008-02-08 06:57:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470454, 640651, 78196, '<td valign="top">Dazzling image processed to perfection. I suspect this would have scored very much higher in a patterns/symmetry challenge but fares less well in a free study. If it''s any consolation I don''t think you could have done this any better.</td>', 'Dazzling image processed to perfection. I suspect this would have scored very much higher in a patterns/symmetry challenge but fares less well in a free study. If it''s any consolation I don''t think you could have done this any better.', '2008-02-08 06:59:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470458, 638552, 78196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, delicate image with lovely bokeh. Often the 1.8 aperture is just too narrow but I think it''s used very well here. Bit surprised at the mediocre score - they''re a demanding bunch these voters!</td>', 'Beautiful, delicate image with lovely bokeh. Often the 1.8 aperture is just too narrow but I think it''s used very well here. Bit surprised at the mediocre score - they''re a demanding bunch these voters!', '2008-02-08 07:01:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470460, 638137, 32997, '<td valign="top">stunning!</td>', 'stunning!', '2008-02-08 07:02:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470461, 640872, 78196, '<td valign="top">The ISO you''ve used here hurts the image quality a little - such a pity you couldn''t have used a tripod. To me, the shot looks very natural and peaceful and not ''overdone'' at all. Nicely done.</td>', 'The ISO you''ve used here hurts the image quality a little - such a pity you couldn''t have used a tripod. To me, the shot looks very natural and peaceful and not ''overdone'' at all. Nicely done.', '2008-02-08 07:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470462, 630611, 38032, '<td valign="top">powerful philosophically -  great colors and texture.</td>', 'powerful philosophically -  great colors and texture.', '2008-02-08 07:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470464, 639497, 78196, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but I get the feeling you''re caught between compositions here - in other words you either need less sky (to emphasise the thirds: trees, mountain, sky) or much more to create a more daring negative space. I know this was shot with a prime but perhaps an unorthodox portrait orientation? It''s just a thought. It''s the implied indecision which prevents the shot really working for me.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but I get the feeling you''re caught between compositions here - in other words you either need less sky (to emphasise the thirds: trees, mountain, sky) or much more to create a more daring negative space. I know this was shot with a prime but perhaps an unorthodox portrait orientation? It''s just a thought. It''s the implied indecision which prevents the shot really working for me.', '2008-02-08 07:06:24.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4470465, 640187, 38032, '<td valign="top">awesome shot G! - Really love this one!</td>', 'awesome shot G! - Really love this one!', '2008-02-08 07:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470468, 637817, 30791, '<td valign="top">man this was one of my favs for the challenge, its a shame it didnt place higher</td>', 'man this was one of my favs for the challenge, its a shame it didnt place higher', '2008-02-08 07:09:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470470, 640774, 38032, '<td valign="top">magical feeling here.  Beautiful and transcending.</td>', 'magical feeling here.  Beautiful and transcending.', '2008-02-08 07:11:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470471, 640912, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great complimentary colors here - fantastic scene</td>', 'Great complimentary colors here - fantastic scene', '2008-02-08 07:13:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470475, 639334, 63269, '<td valign="top">Sounds exactly like my old cat. She <i>loved </i>news papers! ;) Wonderful capture - that sweet expression is hilarious.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-10 10:42:21.</i></td>', 'Sounds exactly like my old cat. She loved news papers! ;) Wonderful capture - that sweet expression is hilarious.', '2008-02-08 07:16:32.000000', '2008-02-10 10:42:21.000000', 0),
(4470477, 640564, 63269, '<td valign="top">Incredible, beautiful lighting!</td>', 'Incredible, beautiful lighting!', '2008-02-08 07:18:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470480, 640924, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fabulous. I wouldn''t change a thing - it''s perfect. Reminded me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=41047" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sevilduvarci</a>''s shots.</td>', 'Fabulous. I wouldn''t change a thing - it''s perfect. Reminded me of  sevilduvarci''s shots.', '2008-02-08 07:22:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470481, 633664, 57060, '<td valign="top">I also thought this was the best in the challenge. Nice work,<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'I also thought this was the best in the challenge. Nice work, Jack', '2008-02-08 07:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470484, 639803, 57060, '<td valign="top">Yes, a beautiful shot and very nicely processed. To me it''s not so much a "flower" shot as it is a color study.<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Yes, a beautiful shot and very nicely processed. To me it''s not so much a "flower" shot as it is a color study. Jack', '2008-02-08 07:28:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470495, 632397, 8637, '<td valign="top">Look at all those 5''s and 6''s!!  Nice capture and great start for your first entry.</td>', 'Look at all those 5''s and 6''s!!  Nice capture and great start for your first entry.', '2008-02-08 07:41:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470498, 639803, 32345, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 10 for this picture, I just love the colors and the post-processing you did on it.</td>', 'I gave you a 10 for this picture, I just love the colors and the post-processing you did on it.', '2008-02-08 07:45:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470505, 640852, 66193, '<td valign="top">Neil, looks like you won the battle of Castlehill Light!  Congrats on the ribbon!  Where we gonna shoot next?</td>', 'Neil, looks like you won the battle of Castlehill Light!  Congrats on the ribbon!  Where we gonna shoot next?', '2008-02-08 07:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470530, 640852, 66597, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo, Neil! Congrats on your much deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Woo hoo, Neil! Congrats on your much deserved ribbon!', '2008-02-08 08:01:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470531, 637390, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great finish, Steve! You and Neil finished pretty close. What a beautiful photo this is.</td>', 'Great finish, Steve! You and Neil finished pretty close. What a beautiful photo this is.', '2008-02-08 08:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470533, 640955, 9821, '<td valign="top">nice image, Brian :)</td>', 'nice image, Brian :)', '2008-02-08 08:04:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470535, 639803, 74979, '<td valign="top">Hey Deb..ooh, darn! I never got to this one!  Lovely reds &amp; image-don''t you dare bail on flowers!!  <br/> <br/>How''s Germany???<br/> <br/>Anne</td>', 'Hey Deb..ooh, darn! I never got to this one!  Lovely reds & image-don''t you dare bail on flowers!!   How''s Germany??? Anne', '2008-02-08 08:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470543, 638612, 54228, '<td valign="top">Awesome processing on this one, I''m surprised it didn''t do better. Congrats on a good shot.</td>', 'Awesome processing on this one, I''m surprised it didn''t do better. Congrats on a good shot.', '2008-02-08 08:16:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470547, 635278, 54228, '<td valign="top">Very cool, love the B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very cool, love the B&W.', '2008-02-08 08:18:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470549, 636976, 54228, '<td valign="top">It is great to see a shot like this place reasonably well, something out of the box. Great work!</td>', 'It is great to see a shot like this place reasonably well, something out of the box. Great work!', '2008-02-08 08:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470551, 636978, 54228, '<td valign="top">Very "SinCity-esque", nice work!</td>', 'Very "SinCity-esque", nice work!', '2008-02-08 08:20:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470553, 634682, 54228, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this one, excellent shot!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this one, excellent shot!', '2008-02-08 08:21:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470554, 640459, 54228, '<td valign="top">This I simply love, I can''t believe it''s all the way down here at number 81, I''d have it on the front page!</td>', 'This I simply love, I can''t believe it''s all the way down here at number 81, I''d have it on the front page!', '2008-02-08 08:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470558, 634256, 78196, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed shot and a lovely subject. I actually think you could have achieved a far superior bokeh with you 50mm 1.4 - the bokeh on this doesn''t quite convince me and I reckon the DoF could be a little shallower as well. But none of that takes away from the fact it''s very nicely done indeed!</td>', 'Beautifully composed shot and a lovely subject. I actually think you could have achieved a far superior bokeh with you 50mm 1.4 - the bokeh on this doesn''t quite convince me and I reckon the DoF could be a little shallower as well. But none of that takes away from the fact it''s very nicely done indeed!', '2008-02-08 08:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470562, 631825, 78196, '<td valign="top">A nice subject which, like the previous commenter said, could perhaps do with a more imaginative composition that captures some of the key aspects you''re trying to convey.</td>', 'A nice subject which, like the previous commenter said, could perhaps do with a more imaginative composition that captures some of the key aspects you''re trying to convey.', '2008-02-08 08:32:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470565, 640819, 78196, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot but think the tree seems a bit out of place and spoils the delicate nature of the ripples a little. I also feel a little detched from the surface of the lake and wonder if you might have taken this from a lower perspective. But a great shot - well done for having the guts to put it in a free study.</td>', 'I like this a lot but think the tree seems a bit out of place and spoils the delicate nature of the ripples a little. I also feel a little detched from the surface of the lake and wonder if you might have taken this from a lower perspective. But a great shot - well done for having the guts to put it in a free study.', '2008-02-08 08:34:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470567, 639573, 38509, '<td valign="top">awesome !</td>', 'awesome !', '2008-02-08 08:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470571, 633427, 38509, '<td valign="top">this is BRILLIANT !!! this is absofreaking (&lt;-- add this word to your dictionaries people) stunning.<br/> <br/>//<br/>g<br/> <br/>eta: ok. why 2007? [insert confused smilie here]<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-08 08:38:53.</i></td>', 'this is BRILLIANT !!! this is absofreaking (<-- add this word to your dictionaries people) stunning. //g eta: ok. why 2007? [insert confused smilie here]', '2008-02-08 08:37:44.000000', '2008-02-08 08:38:53.000000', 0),
(4470578, 638137, 66709, '<td valign="top">congrats on first place for a tilt horizon</td>', 'congrats on first place for a tilt horizon', '2008-02-08 08:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470580, 629050, 78196, '<td valign="top">There''s real energy here and the quirky subject is great fun, though as you''ve probably realised, quirky doesn''t normally resonate well with DPC voters. But you''re awesome for submitting it!</td>', 'There''s real energy here and the quirky subject is great fun, though as you''ve probably realised, quirky doesn''t normally resonate well with DPC voters. But you''re awesome for submitting it!', '2008-02-08 08:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
