(4470595, 635000, 73235, '<td valign="top">Congrats Elvis, guess you made the right choice going b/w. Love the high contrast and level of details.</td>', 'Congrats Elvis, guess you made the right choice going b/w. Love the high contrast and level of details.', '2008-02-08 08:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470596, 633017, 35357, '<td valign="top">We are so tiny!  Beautiful image!</td>', 'We are so tiny!  Beautiful image!', '2008-02-08 08:51:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470602, 639778, 73235, '<td valign="top">Alex,<br/>tough competition with a candid against colorfula and dramatic sunsets. I like the grainy conversion and how you captured the skin tones. Great isolation of your model from the background.</td>', 'Alex,tough competition with a candid against colorfula and dramatic sunsets. I like the grainy conversion and how you captured the skin tones. Great isolation of your model from the background.', '2008-02-08 08:54:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470608, 630611, 15711, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe that didn''t ribbon.  MAN - what a shot.</td>', 'I can''t believe that didn''t ribbon.  MAN - what a shot.', '2008-02-08 08:56:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470609, 639327, 78196, '<td valign="top">A nice street shot - the black and white could do with more contrast though IMO and perhaps a narrower DoF to give emphasis to your subject.</td>', 'A nice street shot - the black and white could do with more contrast though IMO and perhaps a narrower DoF to give emphasis to your subject.', '2008-02-08 08:56:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470612, 636248, 66597, '<td valign="top">Man, you got robbed. I love this photo. It''s gorgeous. Excellent title, too.</td>', 'Man, you got robbed. I love this photo. It''s gorgeous. Excellent title, too.', '2008-02-08 08:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470614, 640852, 3102, '<td valign="top">This is one of those rare instances where I LIKE the effects of tone mapping.  It was done very nicely here, and not to such an extreme like so many other shots nowadays.  This was a 10 from me.  Congrats, Neil!</td>', 'This is one of those rare instances where I LIKE the effects of tone mapping.  It was done very nicely here, and not to such an extreme like so many other shots nowadays.  This was a 10 from me.  Congrats, Neil!', '2008-02-08 08:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470615, 633664, 35357, '<td valign="top">It''s refreshing to see such a beautiful, soft shot like this at DPC.  IMO it has been very under-valued in the scoring, but that''s just the way it goes in the land of sharp-sharp-sharp.  It''s serene and moody in a way very few shots at DPC are.  I''ve been wanting to get a shot of this ilk for a long time, but I''m not nearly there yet.  Congrats on this wonderful work of art.</td>', 'It''s refreshing to see such a beautiful, soft shot like this at DPC.  IMO it has been very under-valued in the scoring, but that''s just the way it goes in the land of sharp-sharp-sharp.  It''s serene and moody in a way very few shots at DPC are.  I''ve been wanting to get a shot of this ilk for a long time, but I''m not nearly there yet.  Congrats on this wonderful work of art.', '2008-02-08 08:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470619, 635468, 78196, '<td valign="top">Brave, fascinating, different, but in my opinion ultimately unsuccessful. The ''pastels'' are fine but too pink for my liking. But with an image like this we''re into properly subjective territory. Kudos for putting this shot in.</td>', 'Brave, fascinating, different, but in my opinion ultimately unsuccessful. The ''pastels'' are fine but too pink for my liking. But with an image like this we''re into properly subjective territory. Kudos for putting this shot in.', '2008-02-08 08:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470629, 640942, 78196, '<td valign="top">I''m scratching my head trying to think of how you could have improved this one. The subject is lovely and the composition completely appropriate. Perhaps a wider view taking in more of the river? I''m not sure the lighting is perfect - the house doesn''t attract much interest as it''s shrouded largely in darkness - if it were lit up a little more I think the effect would be better. But a great winter shot - I''m quite jealous as it hasn''t settled at all over here!</td>', 'I''m scratching my head trying to think of how you could have improved this one. The subject is lovely and the composition completely appropriate. Perhaps a wider view taking in more of the river? I''m not sure the lighting is perfect - the house doesn''t attract much interest as it''s shrouded largely in darkness - if it were lit up a little more I think the effect would be better. But a great winter shot - I''m quite jealous as it hasn''t settled at all over here!', '2008-02-08 09:04:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470631, 637941, 35357, '<td valign="top">A beautiful spot, and perfect shutterspeed.  I love the curvy lines in that liquid jade and all the furry green of the forest to contain it and that lovely bridge.</td>', 'A beautiful spot, and perfect shutterspeed.  I love the curvy lines in that liquid jade and all the furry green of the forest to contain it and that lovely bridge.', '2008-02-08 09:05:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470635, 633664, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice finish.  Really dream-like!!</td>', 'Nice finish.  Really dream-like!!', '2008-02-08 09:06:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470638, 637789, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is very much your style, Charlene. I love it - the starkness, the high contrast with the blue in there - really stunning. Stupid voters, I say! Goes to show you what happens when you try something out of the DPC box.</td>', 'This is very much your style, Charlene. I love it - the starkness, the high contrast with the blue in there - really stunning. Stupid voters, I say! Goes to show you what happens when you try something out of the DPC box.', '2008-02-08 09:08:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470639, 638141, 35357, '<td valign="top">That is a gorgeous cat and I''ll never get tired of seeing it.  Another great shot.  Love the haiku title, my cats think the same way.</td>', 'That is a gorgeous cat and I''ll never get tired of seeing it.  Another great shot.  Love the haiku title, my cats think the same way.', '2008-02-08 09:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470644, 640506, 44877, '<td valign="top">Jon - I love the contrast between the lighted parts of the dome and the dark tree. The tones are really excellent. Is that Satin Steel? Clearly unappreciated and underrated - this is SO not a 4.9.</td>', 'Jon - I love the contrast between the lighted parts of the dome and the dark tree. The tones are really excellent. Is that Satin Steel? Clearly unappreciated and underrated - this is SO not a 4.9.', '2008-02-08 09:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470648, 639734, 44877, '<td valign="top">Well darn, Sarah! So close! I love this shot - the clarity is absolutely wonderful, as are the colors. And you sure did better than I did - ha! :o)</td>', 'Well darn, Sarah! So close! I love this shot - the clarity is absolutely wonderful, as are the colors. And you sure did better than I did - ha! :o)', '2008-02-08 09:13:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470650, 635194, 60614, '<td valign="top">I like the B/W.  I think it would have looked neat if you rotated where the the flower was dropping down into the frame or rotated where it was popping up into the frame instead of from the side.  Try burning around the edges of the frame ever so slightly to see if it makes the flower pop even more.  I think the grain adds some interest.  It is a very nice photo and didn''t deserve a low 5 but that is my opinion.  I also love the simplicity of the shot.  Hopefully you will get some good constructive comments from others who have way more experience than myself.</td>', 'I like the B/W.  I think it would have looked neat if you rotated where the the flower was dropping down into the frame or rotated where it was popping up into the frame instead of from the side.  Try burning around the edges of the frame ever so slightly to see if it makes the flower pop even more.  I think the grain adds some interest.  It is a very nice photo and didn''t deserve a low 5 but that is my opinion.  I also love the simplicity of the shot.  Hopefully you will get some good constructive comments from others who have way more experience than myself.', '2008-02-08 09:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470653, 640852, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hey! Congrats on the ribbon! Nice job on the editing, too. ;-)</td>', 'Hey! Congrats on the ribbon! Nice job on the editing, too. ;-)', '2008-02-08 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470654, 639803, 37961, '<td valign="top">Again, not sure why, but the title takes it over the top for me...beautiful image too.</td>', 'Again, not sure why, but the title takes it over the top for me...beautiful image too.', '2008-02-08 09:16:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470656, 640950, 44877, '<td valign="top">Excellent night shot with brilliant colors - the reflection on the snow is just stunning. There might be a few too many elements in the photo to make it flow well. Nonetheless, I feel it''s sorely underrated.</td>', 'Excellent night shot with brilliant colors - the reflection on the snow is just stunning. There might be a few too many elements in the photo to make it flow well. Nonetheless, I feel it''s sorely underrated.', '2008-02-08 09:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470665, 640974, 50695, '<td valign="top">more evidence of the amazing inability of DPC voters to see a good photo.</td>', 'more evidence of the amazing inability of DPC voters to see a good photo.', '2008-02-08 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470669, 638137, 74534, '<td valign="top">Wow Paolo, a Blue in the Free Study! You ARE the man!<br/> <br/>Excellent composition, with the S-curve leading the eye to the center and the climber there... The B&amp;W conversion works very well as well... Congratulations!</td>', 'Wow Paolo, a Blue in the Free Study! You ARE the man! Excellent composition, with the S-curve leading the eye to the center and the climber there... The B&W conversion works very well as well... Congratulations!', '2008-02-08 09:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470672, 639422, 50695, '<td valign="top">well I hope you learned something from all those brilliant comments.<br/> <br/>Oh wait, did I say "comments"?<br/> <br/>I meant "comment," singular.</td>', 'well I hope you learned something from all those brilliant comments. Oh wait, did I say "comments"? I meant "comment," singular.', '2008-02-08 09:21:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470673, 637992, 44877, '<td valign="top">Well, unlike the majority of the voters, I love this - big fan of high-key (see my miserable scoring Jan FS). You''ve given a good photo an artistic twist and made it visually so much more interesting. The conversion is excellent, too.</td>', 'Well, unlike the majority of the voters, I love this - big fan of high-key (see my miserable scoring Jan FS). You''ve given a good photo an artistic twist and made it visually so much more interesting. The conversion is excellent, too.', '2008-02-08 09:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470676, 635194, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m tired of HDR, but you have a good eye for beauty. I gave this a 6.</td>', 'I''m tired of HDR, but you have a good eye for beauty. I gave this a 6.', '2008-02-08 09:22:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470677, 640924, 44877, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I did notice this image and thought it was completely brilliant (still do)  - had to be yours. You should get a Posthumous Blue for this.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I did notice this image and thought it was completely brilliant (still do)  - had to be yours. You should get a Posthumous Blue for this.', '2008-02-08 09:22:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470683, 635194, 68256, '<td valign="top">Rich, I like the shot and agree with Becky about the rotation..I think it needed a little angular movement in the composition to set it apart (perhaps the dark stem coming in at an angle).  I gave it a 6 during voting and would probably given it 1 mark higher without the HDR look.  It feels like it has gone out of the realm of photography and into the realm of pencil drawing which might have been why it scored lower than expected.  I would like to see the background burned some which might help the flower stand out more too.  Anyway, overall I liked the shot and don''t get too down on that 5.33 in a free study..that is not a bad score at all for a DPC free study.</td>', 'Rich, I like the shot and agree with Becky about the rotation..I think it needed a little angular movement in the composition to set it apart (perhaps the dark stem coming in at an angle).  I gave it a 6 during voting and would probably given it 1 mark higher without the HDR look.  It feels like it has gone out of the realm of photography and into the realm of pencil drawing which might have been why it scored lower than expected.  I would like to see the background burned some which might help the flower stand out more too.  Anyway, overall I liked the shot and don''t get too down on that 5.33 in a free study..that is not a bad score at all for a DPC free study.', '2008-02-08 09:25:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470688, 640852, 81301, '<td valign="top">Wow! amazing photo, very beautiful. congrts on your ribbon.</td>', 'Wow! amazing photo, very beautiful. congrts on your ribbon.', '2008-02-08 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470694, 635194, 79955, '<td valign="top">Gave it a 6. Liked the conversion. Prefer a slightly tighter crop though.</td>', 'Gave it a 6. Liked the conversion. Prefer a slightly tighter crop though.', '2008-02-08 09:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470704, 640014, 44877, '<td valign="top">Yay! Top Ten in FS!! Glad this made up for the - ahem - bird photo. This is the most awesome catch. Go to National Geographic and look around on their site for a way to submit incredible nature photos. I mean - I''m pretty sure that NONE of us have ever seen a dragonfly eat a fly. I didn''t even know that flies were on their menu. In any case - CONGRATULATIONS!!!!</td>', 'Yay! Top Ten in FS!! Glad this made up for the - ahem - bird photo. This is the most awesome catch. Go to National Geographic and look around on their site for a way to submit incredible nature photos. I mean - I''m pretty sure that NONE of us have ever seen a dragonfly eat a fly. I didn''t even know that flies were on their menu. In any case - CONGRATULATIONS!!!!', '2008-02-08 09:34:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470711, 638137, 66193, '<td valign="top"><br/>Gorgeous shot!  Congrats on the blue, and it is certainly deserved.  The contrast, the composition, everything.  Well done!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot!  Congrats on the blue, and it is certainly deserved.  The contrast, the composition, everything.  Well done!', '2008-02-08 09:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470714, 633017, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wow - I''m in awe that you took this with the same camera I have. And wow for the photo. And wow for your skills of knowing what to do and executing it so perfectly. I bet the only reason this didn''t score higher was the voters thinking: nah, this can''t be real...</td>', 'Wow - I''m in awe that you took this with the same camera I have. And wow for the photo. And wow for your skills of knowing what to do and executing it so perfectly. I bet the only reason this didn''t score higher was the voters thinking: nah, this can''t be real...', '2008-02-08 09:37:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470717, 640398, 66193, '<td valign="top">Larus, another wonderful shot!  I, for one, always enjoy these.  Keep em coming!  Some day I''m booking a trip to Iceland; I have to see this for myself!</td>', 'Larus, another wonderful shot!  I, for one, always enjoy these.  Keep em coming!  Some day I''m booking a trip to Iceland; I have to see this for myself!', '2008-02-08 09:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470720, 638548, 66193, '<td valign="top">keith, gorgeous shot!  I love the touch of red and blue in a sea of warmth!  Congrats on a fantastic image.</td>', 'keith, gorgeous shot!  I love the touch of red and blue in a sea of warmth!  Congrats on a fantastic image.', '2008-02-08 09:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470722, 638674, 44877, '<td valign="top">What a stunner - that crazy X in the sky is the bomb. I''m glad the horse was mesmerized by you and didn''t move. And your notes are hilarious.</td>', 'What a stunner - that crazy X in the sky is the bomb. I''m glad the horse was mesmerized by you and didn''t move. And your notes are hilarious.', '2008-02-08 09:42:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470726, 640187, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is priceless. Wonderful crop and colors. Love it.</td>', 'This is priceless. Wonderful crop and colors. Love it.', '2008-02-08 09:43:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470730, 639468, 58452, '<td valign="top">I wish the glow were a larger component of the composition. I do love the red glow.  I find the slightly over exposed windows and roadway in the foreground distracting. I think to make this work you''d have to find another vantage point, probably in another building. Perhaps on one of the middle floors of the bldg in the middle. Shoot for a composition with the tall building on the left filling the left frame with the glow and far buildings mirrored in the water. Just a thought.</td>', 'I wish the glow were a larger component of the composition. I do love the red glow.  I find the slightly over exposed windows and roadway in the foreground distracting. I think to make this work you''d have to find another vantage point, probably in another building. Perhaps on one of the middle floors of the bldg in the middle. Shoot for a composition with the tall building on the left filling the left frame with the glow and far buildings mirrored in the water. Just a thought.', '2008-02-08 09:45:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470747, 633017, 39057, '<td valign="top">Come on people...this kills all the shots in this challenge. Just think of what this is a picture of. Just think of what the "Northern Lights" are and how we all love those pictures. This destroys Northern Lights !<br/> <br/>Also....lets look at "when" this actually occured. This is a picture that was entered in a Challenge in 2008 but actually occured in the year 508 !</td>', 'Come on people...this kills all the shots in this challenge. Just think of what this is a picture of. Just think of what the "Northern Lights" are and how we all love those pictures. This destroys Northern Lights ! Also....lets look at "when" this actually occured. This is a picture that was entered in a Challenge in 2008 but actually occured in the year 508 !', '2008-02-08 09:49:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470753, 638137, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Beautiful shot, great use of leading lines and vertical comp.</td>', 'Congratulations!  Beautiful shot, great use of leading lines and vertical comp.', '2008-02-08 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470757, 640398, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Larus!  One of these days I hope to make it to Iceland!</td>', 'Congratulations Larus!  One of these days I hope to make it to Iceland!', '2008-02-08 09:52:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470778, 638581, 7743, '<td valign="top">I gave your shot a 7.  I like how you isolated the person with the camera.  The OOF person in the foreground works really well at guiding you into the image.</td>', 'I gave your shot a 7.  I like how you isolated the person with the camera.  The OOF person in the foreground works really well at guiding you into the image.', '2008-02-08 10:01:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470785, 635194, 58728, '<td valign="top">Well, this proves that the DPC crowd has a wide range of likes and dislikes, because I love this shot the way it is. I think the crop is lovely, and the b&amp;w conversion is perfect.  I had given it an 8.  I like how it appears to be glowing.  ;)</td>', 'Well, this proves that the DPC crowd has a wide range of likes and dislikes, because I love this shot the way it is. I think the crop is lovely, and the b&w conversion is perfect.  I had given it an 8.  I like how it appears to be glowing.  ;)', '2008-02-08 10:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470786, 635194, 58452, '<td valign="top">As one commenter stated this is more like a pencil drawing than photograph. Almost looks over sharpened due to the HDR.  I would suggest a concept like this. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=498973" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/hidden.png?1'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/hidden.png?1'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/hidden.png?1"/></a> <br/> <br/>Then gradually merge from real daff with color to the pencil drawn one.  Just a thought.</td>', 'As one commenter stated this is more like a pencil drawing than photograph. Almost looks over sharpened due to the HDR.  I would suggest a concept like this.    Then gradually merge from real daff with color to the pencil drawn one.  Just a thought.', '2008-02-08 10:05:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470788, 640534, 7743, '<td valign="top">It does look like a nice scene, however, to me, there''s not enough contrast between the boats and the beach to make them stand out.  Also, the clouds seem to draw the eye since they are the lightest part of the image.<br/> <br/>You can preserve the muted colours (which do work well in this scene) even if you bump the contrast.</td>', 'It does look like a nice scene, however, to me, there''s not enough contrast between the boats and the beach to make them stand out.  Also, the clouds seem to draw the eye since they are the lightest part of the image. You can preserve the muted colours (which do work well in this scene) even if you bump the contrast.', '2008-02-08 10:06:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470789, 640819, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is quite sad. It makes me think the tree is crying. This could account for the unstellar score, as people seem to like shiny, happy pictures. LOL! But, it''s quite lovely and you should be proud of it.</td>', 'This is quite sad. It makes me think the tree is crying. This could account for the unstellar score, as people seem to like shiny, happy pictures. LOL! But, it''s quite lovely and you should be proud of it.', '2008-02-08 10:06:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470808, 639327, 11854, '<td valign="top">Quite quirky! I would love to see him in color, though wondering what colors he''s wearing adds to the charm. Your street shots are always awesome though, it just has a smaller group who appreciate them.</td>', 'Quite quirky! I would love to see him in color, though wondering what colors he''s wearing adds to the charm. Your street shots are always awesome though, it just has a smaller group who appreciate them.', '2008-02-08 10:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470825, 638581, 811, '<td valign="top">I gave it a seven.  :)  I really liked how you captured the "busy-ness" of the scene, but how the one girl is isolated.  Also, this is a really smooth, nicely done bw capture.  To improve it?  I dunno, honestly.  Perhaps a slightly wider crop on the left and less on the right.  That might help to reduce the distraction the guy walking into the frame causes.</td>', 'I gave it a seven.  :)  I really liked how you captured the "busy-ness" of the scene, but how the one girl is isolated.  Also, this is a really smooth, nicely done bw capture.  To improve it?  I dunno, honestly.  Perhaps a slightly wider crop on the left and less on the right.  That might help to reduce the distraction the guy walking into the frame causes.', '2008-02-08 10:11:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470828, 640398, 66348, '<td valign="top">Incredible as always Larus, perfect composition and color. I have to be honest though that your post comment just isn''t necessary, as you know everyone has an opinion and are more jealous than anything, there is no reason to even acknowledge these ones IMO. We already know how good your work is and that you shoot for yourself and not DPC. Your placement speaks for itself how the majority of the people here feel about your shot, so to go off and acknowledge these ones, just doesn''t give this type of shot the credit or justice it deserves. <br/> <br/>Besides we all know that opinions are like Arseholes, everyone has one, and they all STINK!!<br/> <br/>Congrats on the Ribb brotha!!</td>', 'Incredible as always Larus, perfect composition and color. I have to be honest though that your post comment just isn''t necessary, as you know everyone has an opinion and are more jealous than anything, there is no reason to even acknowledge these ones IMO. We already know how good your work is and that you shoot for yourself and not DPC. Your placement speaks for itself how the majority of the people here feel about your shot, so to go off and acknowledge these ones, just doesn''t give this type of shot the credit or justice it deserves.  Besides we all know that opinions are like Arseholes, everyone has one, and they all STINK!! Congrats on the Ribb brotha!!', '2008-02-08 10:12:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470830, 640852, 66348, '<td valign="top">Neil, congrats on an amazing shot and capture. Perfect example of an HDR. Congrats on the Ribb.</td>', 'Neil, congrats on an amazing shot and capture. Perfect example of an HDR. Congrats on the Ribb.', '2008-02-08 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470831, 637992, 70514, '<td valign="top">The white snow really adds punch to the babe''s innocence.  I think it''s a great bonus to a sweet capture.</td>', 'The white snow really adds punch to the babe''s innocence.  I think it''s a great bonus to a sweet capture.', '2008-02-08 10:13:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470832, 638977, 811, '<td valign="top">This has a really good composition.  Very balanced and has "movement" through the frame.  The expressions on their faces make the viewer smile -- they look so happy.  The black and white conversion works well too -- you have good contrast, etc.  The major detractor for me was the grainy look.  A little might have been okay.  This almost struck me as a shot you got in the dark and had to brighten it a lot (and introducing noise) to get it to work.</td>', 'This has a really good composition.  Very balanced and has "movement" through the frame.  The expressions on their faces make the viewer smile -- they look so happy.  The black and white conversion works well too -- you have good contrast, etc.  The major detractor for me was the grainy look.  A little might have been okay.  This almost struck me as a shot you got in the dark and had to brighten it a lot (and introducing noise) to get it to work.', '2008-02-08 10:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470833, 633148, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Amazing contrasting textures throughout.  Great eye.</td>', 'Wow!  Amazing contrasting textures throughout.  Great eye.', '2008-02-08 10:14:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470835, 640869, 66348, '<td valign="top">Yup this rocks. Congrats on an amazing capture.</td>', 'Yup this rocks. Congrats on an amazing capture.', '2008-02-08 10:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470838, 640854, 811, '<td valign="top">At first glance I didn''t like this one, but then, the more I looked at it, the more I did.  :)  I thought it was really cool how just the tips of his wings were touching.  Looks almost like he is standing on them.  A crop/composition that didn''t have him quite so centered may have given the picture a bit more dynamic feeling.  He is pretty centered, and while it looks like he is getting ready to fly, there is nowhere for him to fly to.  Of course, I am one of your two nines, so . . . .:)<br/> <br/> &lt;stage whispers:  YOU WAS ROBBED!&gt;</td>', 'At first glance I didn''t like this one, but then, the more I looked at it, the more I did.  :)  I thought it was really cool how just the tips of his wings were touching.  Looks almost like he is standing on them.  A crop/composition that didn''t have him quite so centered may have given the picture a bit more dynamic feeling.  He is pretty centered, and while it looks like he is getting ready to fly, there is nowhere for him to fly to.  Of course, I am one of your two nines, so . . . .:)  <stage whispers:  YOU WAS ROBBED!>', '2008-02-08 10:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470842, 640430, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great reflection captured in the tv as well.  I''m guessing you''re not the only one who noticed it.  I wonder how long before it was gone.</td>', 'Great reflection captured in the tv as well.  I''m guessing you''re not the only one who noticed it.  I wonder how long before it was gone.', '2008-02-08 10:17:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470843, 640703, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''m one of your 15 7''s..and I really like this shot.  It didn''t really connect emotionally with me as far as content goes, but compositionally and lighting it really made an impression on me.  The exposure of those bricks and captureing all their contrast next to the blown out sky outside of the tunnel is just wonderful.</td>', 'I''m one of your 15 7''s..and I really like this shot.  It didn''t really connect emotionally with me as far as content goes, but compositionally and lighting it really made an impression on me.  The exposure of those bricks and captureing all their contrast next to the blown out sky outside of the tunnel is just wonderful.', '2008-02-08 10:17:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470845, 630611, 66348, '<td valign="top">MAK, well done brotha, lights out shot, and highly underrated IMO. Great capture man.</td>', 'MAK, well done brotha, lights out shot, and highly underrated IMO. Great capture man.', '2008-02-08 10:18:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470848, 640506, 70514, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the duotone you chose here.  (It is a duotone, right?)  Great composition and angle.  A very nice sharp night image without noise.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Absolutely love the duotone you chose here.  (It is a duotone, right?)  Great composition and angle.  A very nice sharp night image without noise.  Nicely done.', '2008-02-08 10:19:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470849, 640974, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the overall composition is done very well -- like figaro said, we automatically look up and out to see what the dog is looking at, and find ourselves pulling to get loose to go.   If possible, I think more space up and to the left, creating more negative space would have made it stronger.  Maybe also a slightly lower perspective, so I don''t feel like I am just standing there looking down on a dog.  And last but not least, the dog''s whites look almost pinkish on my screen, especially up near the head.  This gives at least the illusion of being slightly off in exposure and lacking brightness</td>', 'I think the overall composition is done very well -- like figaro said, we automatically look up and out to see what the dog is looking at, and find ourselves pulling to get loose to go.   If possible, I think more space up and to the left, creating more negative space would have made it stronger.  Maybe also a slightly lower perspective, so I don''t feel like I am just standing there looking down on a dog.  And last but not least, the dog''s whites look almost pinkish on my screen, especially up near the head.  This gives at least the illusion of being slightly off in exposure and lacking brightness', '2008-02-08 10:20:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470850, 633143, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wow Ches!  Very striking composition and the colors are so beautiful.  Lovely capture.</td>', 'Wow Ches!  Very striking composition and the colors are so beautiful.  Lovely capture.', '2008-02-08 10:21:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470853, 633017, 66348, '<td valign="top">In total agreement with Kenskid. These shots are the most underrated on the site. I mean they are just mind boggling. Congrats on another just amazing shot.</td>', 'In total agreement with Kenskid. These shots are the most underrated on the site. I mean they are just mind boggling. Congrats on another just amazing shot.', '2008-02-08 10:21:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470855, 640014, 67697, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of bug pics lol.  They just creep me out.  And this one does too - but only because of the clarity and focus.  It is so real!  I love the balance of orange and yellow in this pic.  Congrats on the top 10 in a FS!</td>', 'I am not a fan of bug pics lol.  They just creep me out.  And this one does too - but only because of the clarity and focus.  It is so real!  I love the balance of orange and yellow in this pic.  Congrats on the top 10 in a FS!', '2008-02-08 10:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470863, 633664, 20608, '<td valign="top">Very ''Watercolour'' really like this shot, nice finish too.</td>', 'Very ''Watercolour'' really like this shot, nice finish too.', '2008-02-08 10:24:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470865, 640490, 811, '<td valign="top">That is a really nice sky; I think cropping it so that more sky and less mountains would have helped the strength of this shot.  Also, the moon just looks odd to me.  Almost like a cartoon stuck in there.  I don''t know how you processed it, but if you could have kept some of the details there, and in the  mountains I think it would have more depth.  As it is now, the straight moon and sky look a bit flat, and the mountains a bit contrasty.</td>', 'That is a really nice sky; I think cropping it so that more sky and less mountains would have helped the strength of this shot.  Also, the moon just looks odd to me.  Almost like a cartoon stuck in there.  I don''t know how you processed it, but if you could have kept some of the details there, and in the  mountains I think it would have more depth.  As it is now, the straight moon and sky look a bit flat, and the mountains a bit contrasty.', '2008-02-08 10:25:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470866, 633664, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  I love the soft glow of the picture and the smooth and glossy features of the reflection.  How nice of the geese to fly in for you at that moment lol.  Very nice!</td>', 'This is very pretty.  I love the soft glow of the picture and the smooth and glossy features of the reflection.  How nice of the geese to fly in for you at that moment lol.  Very nice!', '2008-02-08 10:25:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470867, 635468, 11854, '<td valign="top">I do prefer the dark version for a print, though the pastels would be great for a painting. I tend to also make my pictures into a "painting", I think because I wish I could paint. Nice work and hooray for those of us who love our pictures no matter what the score.</td>', 'I do prefer the dark version for a print, though the pastels would be great for a painting. I tend to also make my pictures into a "painting", I think because I wish I could paint. Nice work and hooray for those of us who love our pictures no matter what the score.', '2008-02-08 10:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470869, 640854, 70514, '<td valign="top">Love the capture of wings just barely gracing the water. Wow!  You''re timing was impeccable.  The background really pulls my attention straight to the bird.  I think it''s great.</td>', 'Love the capture of wings just barely gracing the water. Wow!  You''re timing was impeccable.  The background really pulls my attention straight to the bird.  I think it''s great.', '2008-02-08 10:27:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470871, 639445, 67697, '<td valign="top">Sunshine, flowers, butterflies... is this what it looks like now where you live?  Lucky girl!  This is a beautiful shot.  I love the clarity and warmth projected from this image.  I''m ready for spring!</td>', 'Sunshine, flowers, butterflies... is this what it looks like now where you live?  Lucky girl!  This is a beautiful shot.  I love the clarity and warmth projected from this image.  I''m ready for spring!', '2008-02-08 10:27:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470875, 640942, 11854, '<td valign="top">Jeb, I think this is a beautiful shot and gave it an 8 in voting. Peaceful and serene is what immediately came to my mind when i first saw this. I could imagine being in the cabin, in front of a fireplace looking out over the calm water.</td>', 'Jeb, I think this is a beautiful shot and gave it an 8 in voting. Peaceful and serene is what immediately came to my mind when i first saw this. I could imagine being in the cabin, in front of a fireplace looking out over the calm water.', '2008-02-08 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470881, 636248, 67697, '<td valign="top">The title was actually the first thing to catch my eye today.  We have terrible flooding going on in our area now.  It is nice to see this scene with the smooth and calm waters.  I love the colors of the sky and the starburst lights are a very pretty addition to the photo.</td>', 'The title was actually the first thing to catch my eye today.  We have terrible flooding going on in our area now.  It is nice to see this scene with the smooth and calm waters.  I love the colors of the sky and the starburst lights are a very pretty addition to the photo.', '2008-02-08 10:31:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470882, 640060, 9821, '<td valign="top">this is very well done ... great mood ... i gave it a 10</td>', 'this is very well done ... great mood ... i gave it a 10', '2008-02-08 10:31:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470884, 638823, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot was both delicate and elegant.  I really like it and think it would make an absolutely gorgeous print!</td>', 'This shot was both delicate and elegant.  I really like it and think it would make an absolutely gorgeous print!', '2008-02-08 10:32:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4470885, 637979, 9821, '<td valign="top">loved it, gave it a 10</td>', 'loved it, gave it a 10', '2008-02-08 10:32:21.000000', NULL, 0),
