(4687062, 639729, 93319, '<td valign="top">I was viewing the Fashion Gallery and ran into your early entry.<br/> <br/>I like the tension with the track and the model''s expression. Well connected.<br/> <br/>I would have like to see the same shot, but pose the model in a triangle posed to matched the lines with tracks.<br/> <br/>peace. <br/></td>', 'I was viewing the Fashion Gallery and ran into your early entry. I like the tension with the track and the model''s expression. Well connected. I would have like to see the same shot, but pose the model in a triangle posed to matched the lines with tracks. peace. ', '2008-05-07 12:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
