(4705427, 628977, 52713, '<td valign="top">Hey! That looks familiar ;-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=478696" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/643/120/478696.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/643/120/478696.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/643/120/478696.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Sorry  you didn''t score as well as  you would have liked. I think the gray-ish background hurt your score the most. The lighting is a little flat too. My shot along these lines took several backgrounds and lighting angles to get something I liked.<br/> <br/>I hope you enter more free studies!<br/></td>', 'Hey! That looks familiar ;-)   Sorry  you didn''t score as well as  you would have liked. I think the gray-ish background hurt your score the most. The lighting is a little flat too. My shot along these lines took several backgrounds and lighting angles to get something I liked. I hope you enter more free studies!', '2008-05-15 21:55:53.000000', NULL, 0),
